 doesn't clearly tie that figure to menopause, and I'd treat it as unverified.\n- **Amazon sales ranking:** A March 2026 report tracked 134 menopause supplement products by real Amazon monthly sales data. It's a marketplace ranking, not an ad-revenue figure, and the results I got didn't show the brand rankings.\n- **Ad-activity lists:** Eva Commerce's October 2026 guide notes that its list does not show ad spend, reach or results for any brand, so it can't answer the revenue question. Brands such as Equelle and Provitalize appear only as ad-library profiles.\n\nFor a real answer, you'd need a paid tool like Particl or AdManage with Meta spend estimates, or the brand's own disclosures.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e1fd003f-3888-4f1d-b2bb-4c921c96c12b","uuid":"e920ea66-317c-4569-b74c-f5f8613adb67","timestamp":"2026-11-20T01:57:51.103Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"best selling menopause supplement brand Facebook ads 2026 revenue","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01JScrscNqTervWSEHJLDAbR","content":[{"title":"AdManage.ai logo","url":"https://admanage.ai/ad-library/hormonal-health-specialist---dr.-olivia-bennett"},{"title":"adlibrary.com Logoadlibrary.com","url":"https://adlibrary.com/brands/equelle-facebook-ads"},{"title":"adlibrary.com Logoadlibrary.com","url":"https://adlibrary.com/brands/provitalize-facebook-ads"},{"title":"Happy Mammoth: Aussie supplement business accused of conning women into buying its products with false claims","url":"https://thenightly.com.au/australia/happy-mammoth-aussie-supplement-business-accused-of-conning-women-into-buying-its-products-with-false-claims-c-18672355"},{"title":"The ‘top’ menopause supplements on social media","url":"https://www.medicalrepublic.com.au/?p=125087"},{"title":"rejuvit labs  llc a24 1241022 rejuvit labs  llc","url":"https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/rejuvit-labs--llc-a24-1241022-rejuvit-labs--l