{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JtTQKc4CpyNMRcVV1RfzZy","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Happy Mammoth Hormone Harmony price ads menopause claims ACCC\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"happy mammoth\",\"url\":\"https://bbbprograms.org/media/newsroom/decisions/happy-mammoth\"},{\"title\":\"happy mammoth hormone harmony\",\"url\":\"https://truthinadvertising.org/articles/happy-mammoth-hormone-harmony/\"},{\"title\":\"national advertising division recommends happy mammoth discontinue certain health related claims for hormone harmony dietary supplement\",\"url\":\"https://ipsnews.net/business/2024/08/20/national-advertising-division-recommends-happy-mammoth-discontinue-certain-health-related-claims-for-hormone-harmony-dietary-supplement/?amp=1\"},{\"title\":\"ipsnews.net\",\"url\":\"https://ipsnews.net/business/?p=210950\"},{\"title\":\"happy mammoth letter re menopause supplement\",\"url\":\"https://truthinadvertising.org/happy-mammoth-letter-re-menopause-supplement\"},{\"title\":\"gnwcq 2024 8 20 national advertising division recommends happy mammoth discontinue certain health related claims for hormone harmony dietary supplement\",\"url\":\"https://markets.financialcontent.com/dowtheoryletters/article/gnwcq-2024-8-20-national-advertising-division-recommends-happy-mammoth-discontinue-certain-health-related-claims-for-hormone-harmony-dietary-supplement\"},{\"title\":\"happy koala llc a24 1241023 happy koala llc\",\"url\":\"https://asa.org.uk/rulings/happy-koala-llc-a24-1241023-happy-koala-llc.html\"},{\"title\":\"Happy Mammoth Hormone Harmony Review: is it effective for menopause relief\",\"url\":\"https://www.skool.com/supplements-1934/happy-mammoth-hormone-harmony-review-is-it-effective-for-menopause-relief\"},{\"title\":\"Menopause Supplements\",\"url\":\"https://truthinadvertising.org/industries/menopause-supplements/\"},{\"title\":\"Happy Mammoth: Aussie supplement business accused of conning women into buying its products with false claims\",\"url\":\"https://thenightly.com.au/australia/happy-mammoth-aussie-supplement-business-accused-of-conning-women-into-buying-its-products-with-false-claims-c-18672355\"},{\"title\":\"www.vbdata.cn\",\"url\":\"https://www.vbdata.cn/intelDetail/571176\"},{\"title\":\"This 'potent' hormone supplement helps with bloating, energy, hot flushes, sleep and more\",\"url\":\"https://www.hellomagazine.com/healthandbeauty/873632/happy-mammoth-supplements-hormone-harmony/?viewas=amp\"},{\"title\":\"This 'potent' hormone supplement helps with bloating, energy, hot flushes, sleep and more\",\"url\":\"https://www.hellomagazine.com/healthandbeauty/873632/happy-mammoth-supplements-hormone-harmony\"},{\"title\":\"hormone harmony\",\"url\":\"https://consumerlab.com/answers/are-hormone-harmony-and-other-happy-mammoth-supplements-worth-taking/hormone-harmony\"},{\"title\":\"Menopause Supplements\",\"url\":\"https://articles.skeptics.nz/2026/01/20/menopause-supplements\"},{\"title\":\"Happy Mammoth  Reviews 12,570\",\"url\":\"https://nz.trustpilot.com/review/happymammoth.com?page=3\"},{\"title\":\"www.tga.gov.au\",\"url\":\"https://www.tga.gov.au/node/447489\"},{\"title\":\"Brands urged to avoid misleading menopause marketing following ASA rulings\",\"url\":\"https://www.nutraingredients.com/Article/2024/08/08/Brands-urged-to-avoid-misleading-menopause-marketing-following-ASA-rulings\"},{\"title\":\"Reviews and Information for Happy Mammoth\",\"url\":\"https://consumerlab.com/happy-mammoth\"}]\n\nI found no ACCC results for Happy Mammoth Hormone Harmony. The results cover other regulators and the company's advertising in several countries.\n\n- **US (NAD, 2024):** The National Advertising Division recommended that Happy Mammoth discontinue certain health claims for the product. During the proceeding, Happy Mammoth agreed to voluntarily discontinue certain claims including \"Relieves mood swings and boosts energy\" and \"Reduces... fluid retention.\" A later summary says the claims included \"Relieves symptoms of Menopause\", \"Relieves hot flashes\", \"Improve sleep quality\" and \"Reduces bloating and gas\". NAD found the studies submitted had limitations that rendered them insufficient to support the challenged claims.\n- **Price:** Truth in Advertising said the product costs $70 for a one-month supply and was marketed as if it were an FDA-approved drug.\n- **Weight-loss claims (Australia):** The Nightly reported that its website claims customers who use Hormone Harmony lose \"on average between 3-9 kgs in 14-30 days\", with ads describing \"flush out 8kg of hormonal weight.\"\n- **Australian regulator (TGA):** The TGA's register shows Happy Mammoth Hormone Harmony Cancelled under Section 30(1)(c) of the Act. The result doesn't give a date or reason beyond that.\n- **UK (ASA):** The ASA ruled against Happy Mammoth's MenoDaily ad over claims that it could prevent, treat or cure menopause symptoms. That was for a different product.\n\nThe search didn't surface any ACCC enforcement action, investigation, or statement on this product. A follow-up search aimed at the ACCC site or Australian consumer law coverage would be needed to check that.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e1fd003f-3888-4f1d-b2bb-4c921c96c12b","uuid":"6b4bed76-4270-4f67-8f43-f052e9c1b5f6","timestamp":"2026-11-20T01:58:01.694Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Happy Mammoth Hormone Harmony price ads menopause claims ACCC","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_017Zuw1G8t9hVCrsopf7ViEd","content":[{"title":"happy mammoth","url":"https://bbbprograms.org/media/newsroom/decisions/happy-mammoth"},{"title":"happy mammoth hormone harmony","url":"https://truthinadvertising.org/articles/happy-mammoth-hormone-harmony/"},{"title":"national advertising division recommends happy mammoth discontinue certain health related claims for hormone harmony dietary supplement","url":"https://ipsnews.net/business/2024/08/20/national-advertising-division-recommends-happy-mammoth-discontinue-certain-health-related-claims-for-hormone-harmony-dietary-supplement/?amp=1"},{"title":"ipsnews.net","url":"https://ipsnews.net/business/?p=210950"},{"title":"happy mammoth letter re menopause supplement","url":"https://truthinadvertising.org/happy-mammoth-letter-re-menopause-supplement"},{"title":"gnwcq 2024 8 20 national advertising division recommends happy mammoth discontinue certain health related claims for hormone harmony dietary supplement","url":"https://markets.financialcontent.com/dowtheoryletters/article/gnwcq-2024-8-20-national-advertising-division-recommends-happy-mammoth-discontinue-certain-health-related-claims-for-hormone-harmony-dietary-supplement"},{"title":"happy koala llc a24 1241023 happy koala llc","url":"https://asa.org.uk/rulings/happy-koala-llc-a24-1241023-happy-koala-llc.html"},{"title":"Happy Mammoth Hormone Harmony Review: is it effective for menopause relief","url":"https://www.skool.com/supplements-1934/happy-mammoth-hormone-harmony-review-is-it-effective-for-menopause-relief"},{"title":"Menopause Supplements","url":"https://truthinadvertising.org/industries/menopause-supplements/"},{"title":"Happy Mammoth: Aussie supplement business accused of conning women into buying its products with false claims","url":"https://thenightly.com.au/australia/happy-mammoth-aussie-supplement-business-accused-of-conning-women-into-buying-its-products-with-false-claims-c-18672355"},{"title":"www.vbdata.cn","url":"https://www.vbdata.cn/intelDetail/571176"},{"title":"This 'potent' hormone supplement helps with bloating, energy, hot flushes, sleep and more","url":"https://www.hellomagazine.com/healthandbeauty/873632/happy-mammoth-supplements-hormone-harmony/?viewas=amp"},{"title":"This 'potent' hormone supplement helps with bloating, energy, hot flushes, sleep and more","url":"https://www.hellomagazine.com/healthandbeauty/87