y Cancelled under Section 30(1)(c) of the Act. The result doesn't give a date or reason beyond that.\n- **UK (ASA):** The ASA ruled against Happy Mammoth's MenoDaily ad over claims that it could prevent, treat or cure menopause symptoms. That was for a different product.\n\nThe search didn't surface any ACCC enforcement action, investigation, or statement on this product. A follow-up search aimed at the ACCC site or Australian consumer law coverage would be needed to check that."],"durationSeconds":6.832220290999998,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JtTQKc4CpyNMRcVV1RfzZy","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WGYaMRaiNCrGdyBRTMJT5r","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"menopause protein powder shake brand soy isoflavones Facebook ads\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Revival's Shakes Boast Doctor-formulated Soy Protein as Key Component\",\"url\":\"https://www.trendhunter.com/trends/menopause-products\"},{\"title\":\"Menopause Supplements\",\"url\":\"https://articles.skeptics.nz/2026/01/20/menopause-supplements\"},{\"title\":\"MPowder MENO-BOOST Menopause Supplement 600g\",\"url\":\"https://www.hollandandbarrett.com/shop/product/mpowder-meno-boost-menopause-supplement-62832\"},{\"title\":\"Dairy Free\",\"url\":\"https://www.hollandandbarrett.com/shop/product/bomimo-the-menoshake-chocolate-protein-blend-62640\"},{\"title\":\"The Menopause Power Shake: A High-Protein, High-Fiber Daily Ritual\",\"url\":\"https://thepauselife.com/blogs/the-pause-blog/menopause-protein-shake\"},{\"title\":\"rejuvit labs  llc a24 1241022 rejuvit labs  llc\",\"url\":\"https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/rejuvit-labs--llc-a24-1241022-rejuvit-labs--llc.html\"},{\"title\":\"Rebekah Brown dreamed up\",\"url\":\"https://www.selfridges.com/FR/en/cat/mpowder-peri-boost-menopause-supplement-900g_R03880009/\"},{\"title\":\"6 supplements support healthy menopause\",\"url\":\"https://www.weightwatchers.com/ca/en/blog/6-supplements-support-healthy-menopause\"},{\"title\":\"June 3, 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.joinmidi.com/post/protein-supplements-for-women\"},{\"title\":\"Soy Shakes For Energy | Soy For Women's Health | Soy For Healthy Hair | Soy For Workouts | Soy Shakes To Lose Weight\",\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/173283628\"},{\"title\":\"Best Protein Powder For Menopause Weight Loss\",\"url\":\"https://aloha.com/collections/best-protein-powder-for-menopause-weight-loss\"},{\"title\":\"Soy vs. Whey for Women in menopause\",\"url\":\"https://rpstrength.com/blogs/articles/soy-vs-whey-for-women-in-menopause\"},{\"title\":\"Collection: Menopause Weight Management\",\"url\":\"https://www.vitacost.com/collections/menopause-weight-management?page=1\"},{\"title\":\"O Positiv Expands Menopause Line with MENO Healthy Aging Collagen & Protein Powder\",\"url\":\"https://gazette.com/2025/09/23/o-positiv-expands-menopause-line-with-meno-healthy-aging-collagen-protein-powder/\"}]\n\nI ran one search. It turned up a few relevant threads, though none of them directly links a specific menopause protein shake brand to a Facebook ad campaign.\n\n- **Revival Soy** is the closest match. Its shakes are marketed around soy protein for hot flashes and night sweats. A trend report describes the brand as occupying that niche, and the brand's own video page makes a menopause-relief claim. It cites a study that reported nearly a 40% reduction over 12 weeks, and the study was partly funded by Physicians Laboratories. Treat that as company marketing, not independent evidence.\n- **Regulatory action on Facebook ads:** The UK's Advertising Standards Authority ruled that two paid Facebook ads for Rejuvit, a supplement company, breached advertising code rules by claiming the products could treat menopause symptoms. A separate Skeptics NZ piece says a Facebook ad for Happy Koala claimed it could cure menopause symptoms and made weight-loss claims. Both are supplement examples rather than protein shakes.\n- **Isoflavone evidence:** A 2025 meta-analysis, as summarized by RP Strength, reported meaningful improvements in menopausal symptoms from soy isoflavones, with the strongest effects on hot flashes and mood. Skeptics NZ, however, says the evidence for soy isoflavones is limited, with the main support being a possible cholesterol-lowering effect. The two sources disagree, so the evidence should be treated as mixed.\n- **Other products:** MPowder's Meno-Boost and Peri-Boost contain soy isoflavones. Holland & Barrett's notes say isoflavones may be unsuitable for women with a history of some cancers. O Positiv launched a menopause-focused collagen and protein powder in 2025.\n\nIf you need a specific brand's Facebook ad history, I'd suggest checking Meta's Ad Library directly, since this search didn't surface it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e1fd003f-3888-4f1d-b2bb-4c921c96c12b","uuid":"998f8031-3f48-4fe0-8ce5-05ae61f35e6d","timestamp":"2026-11-20T01:58:02.040Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"menopause protein powder shake brand soy isoflavones Facebook ads","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_0166th4HLBYFqVQwu7Zzxrob","content":[{"title":"Revival's Shakes Boast Doctor-formulated Soy Protein as Key Component","url":"https://www.trendhunter.com/trends/menopause-products"},{"title":"Menopause Supplements","url":"https://articles.skeptics.nz/2026/01/20/menopause-supplements"},{"title":"MPowder MENO-BOOST Menopause Supplement 600g","url":"https://www.hollandandbarrett.com/shop/product/mpowder-meno-boost-menopause-supplement-62832"},{"title":"Dairy Free","url":"https://www.hollandandbarrett.com/shop/product/bomimo-the-menoshake-chocolate-protein-blend-62640"},{"title":"The Menopause Power Shake: A High-Protein, High-Fiber Daily Ritual","url":"https://thepauselife.com/blogs/the-pause-blog/menopause-protein-shake"},{"title":"rejuvit labs  llc a24 1241022 rejuvit labs  llc","url":"https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/rejuvit-labs--llc-a24-1241022-rejuvit-labs--llc.html"},{"title":"Rebekah Brown dreamed up","url":"https://www.selfridges.com/FR/en/cat/mpowder-peri-boost-menopause-supplement-900g_R03880009/"},{"title":"6 supplements support healthy menopause","url":"https://www.weightwatchers.com/ca/en/blog/6-supplements-support-healthy-menopause"},{"title":"June 3, 2026","url":"https://www.joinmidi.com/post/protein-supplements-for-women"},{"title":"Soy Shakes For Energy | Soy For Women's Health | Soy For Healthy Hair | Soy For Workouts | Soy Shakes To Lose Weight","url":"https://vimeo.com/173283628"},{"title":"Best Protein Powder For Menopause Weight Loss","url":"https://aloha.com/collections/best-protein-powder-for-menopause-weight-loss"},{"title":"Soy vs. Whey for Women in menopause","url":"https://rpstrength.com/blogs/articles/soy-vs-whey-for-women-in-menopause"},{"title":"Collection: Menopause Weight Management","url":"https://www.vitacost.com/collections/menopause-weight-management?page=1"},{"title":"O Positiv Expands Menopause Line with MENO Healthy Aging Collagen & Protein Powder","url":"https://gazette.com/2025/09/23/o-positiv-expands-menopause-line-with-meno-healthy-aging-collagen-protein-powder/"}]},"I ran one search. It turned up a few relevant threads, though none of them directly links a specific menopause protein shake brand to a Facebook ad campaign.\n\n- **Revival Soy** is the closest match. Its shakes are marketed around soy protein for hot flashes and night sweats. A trend report describes the brand as occupying that niche, and the brand's own video page makes a menopause-relief claim. It cites a study that reported nearly a 40% reduction over 12 weeks, and the study was partly funded by Physicians Laboratories. Treat that as company marketing, not independent evidence.\n- **Regulatory action on Facebook ads:** The UK's Advertising Standards Authority ruled that two paid Facebook ads for Rejuvit, a supplement company, breached advertising code rules by claiming the products could treat menopause symptoms. A separate Skeptics NZ piece says a Facebook ad for Happy Koala claimed it could cure menopause symptoms and made weight-loss claims. Both are supplement examples rather than protein shakes.\n- **Isoflavone evidence:** A 2025 meta-analysis, as summarized by RP Strength, reported meaningful improvements in menopausal symptoms from soy isoflavones, with the strongest effects on hot flashes and mood. Skeptics NZ, however, says the evidence for soy isoflavones is limited, with the main support being a possible cholesterol-lowering effect. The two sources disagree, so the evidence should be treated as mixed.\n- **Other products:** MPowder's Meno-Boost and Peri-Boost contain soy isoflavones. Holland & Barrett's notes say isoflavones may be unsuitable for women with a history of some cancers. O Positiv launched a menopause-focused collagen and protein powder in 2025.\n\nIf you need a specific brand's Facebook ad history, I'd suggest checking Meta's Ad Library directly, since this search didn't surface it."],"durationSeconds":6.577965292000008,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WGYaMRaiNCrGdyBRTMJT5r","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
